            "review_title": "Review at Bami Pan",
            "review_text": "Mcqueen J\n3 contributions\n1\nGreat cheese steak bread in Hanoi\nJun 2019 • Solo\nNice cheese steak bread with airy crumb and crackly, toasted crust. The steak has great smoky flavour and tender enough. Lots of cheese sauce over pepper and onion. They also have special peach lemongrass tea which is so good that I bought 2.\nWritten June 27, 2019",
